      "slot": "keeps-tax",
      "tier": "official_act",
      "text": "Votes to keep in place the existing tax system, in which tax revenue equals about 26 percent of annual economic output, the top tax rate on earnings is about 44 percent in a typical city, counting regional and local taxes that vary by place, starting at about 9 times the average wage, and the tax rate on company profits is about 26 percent counting regional taxes.",
